{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can your friendship survive Fruit Golf?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruit Golf is pure, unfiltered party chaos disguised as mini golf! Putt a pineapple down a pirate ship while your friends go full sabotage with sharks, exploding barrels, and even flying pigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/78fe0237815902bad30ead90a14df98a.poster.avif?t=1774980003\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/78fe0237815902bad30ead90a14df98a.webm?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/78fe0237815902bad30ead90a14df98a.mp4?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Your Perfect Fruit!</strong> Every fruit bends the rules in its own way, with unique physics and quirks that can turn a simple putt into a power move\u2026If you can master it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/c973f01f16a881f6a1a3722b6820a359.poster.avif?t=1774980003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/c973f01f16a881f6a1a3722b6820a359.webm?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/c973f01f16a881f6a1a3722b6820a359.mp4?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE HEADSETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head in VR! Online or in-person, take turns golfing and sabotaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE HEADSET HOTSEAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones  to wreak havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLO PRACTICE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.poster.avif?t=1774980003\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.webm?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/ecba7728eb13499a19ebb023a72917f9.mp4?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks &amp; Customization: </strong>Complete challenges, score new gear, and show off just enough to make your friends wildly jealous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.poster.avif?t=1774980003\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.webm?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/9fdbe55a8dc4eb33619e7e9f5c923e77.mp4?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off-the-Wall Obstacles:</strong> Sabotage every shot with floppy sharks, dust devils, ectoplasm, mouse traps, portals, and all kinds of chaotic trickery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/2acf1fb6bdbc823f581e3ee8cbc3df1e.poster.avif?t=1774980003\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/2acf1fb6bdbc823f581e3ee8cbc3df1e.webm?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/extras/2acf1fb6bdbc823f581e3ee8cbc3df1e.mp4?t=1774980003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrageously Fun Courses:</strong> Play under the sea, in space, in the kitchen, and across other themed courses; then mix and match obstacles to craft your own chaotic masterpiece.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/406890?t=1774980003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774980003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/3ba89fd190af7cc197c44ba38ea4c2a25b141611/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774980003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/406890/3ba89fd190af7cc197c44ba38ea4c2a25b141611/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774980003","categor